'reversible'    -0.6417   0.0

! logKfr = 4.337 [mg/l^0.35 / mg/kg] rhobulk = 0.45 for AC

!'inhibition T^a'  1
!'=c6h6'   0.0100  2.0d0
!
! 'fractional T^a'  1
! 'c6h6'     1.000
!
! 'hyperbolic T^a' 2
! 'c6h6'   1.0d-5     1.0d0
! 'c6h6'   1.d-10     2.0d0
! Keq = aq.sol of benzene; DH = 0:     -1.6417   0.0
! durch gebrochene Stöchiometrie dürfte man einen Freundlich hinkriegen, aber mehr geht wohl nicht...
! inhibition-term: max. sorption capacity [mol/l bulk]
! ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!
!
! benzene degradation - aerobic respiration - Monod-kinetics (depending on biomass)
! **************************  added UM2, 4, 24.10.2007 ****************************
