'irreversible'

'fractional T^a'  1
'hs-1'   1.0

'hyperbolic T^a'  2
'o2(aq)' 1.d-4    1.0d0
'o2(aq)' 1.d-6    2.0d0

'activation energy' 12.37        ! just a housenumber 

